        },
        {
          "path": "_m/9/y/u/w/kansas-city-power-and-light-building-wp/powerandlightbuilding.jpg",
          "filename": "PowerandLightBuilding.jpg",
          "caption": "The Power &amp; Light Building viewed from the south at night (2020), the historic building built in the 1930s and was the tallest skyscraper west of the Mississippi River until the '60s have been converted into luxury apartments and has lights that illuminate unique colors that coordinate with special events in the city such as sports teams games, holidays, etc.",
          "alt": "The Power &amp; Light Building viewed from the south at night (2020), the historic building built in the 1930s and was the tallest skyscraper west of the Mississippi River until the '60s have been converted into luxury apartments and has lights that illuminate unique colors that coordinate with special events in the city such as sports teams games, holidays, etc.",
